{"version":1,"content":"<p>陳冠希（Edison）久未在港露面，昨晚（30日）驚喜現身《SPOOKY Halloween》萬聖節音樂嘉年華，更上台開金口，憑歌寄意唱快歌《記得我嗎》，掀樂迷回憶殺；</p><p>同場還有藝人葉泓聲與太太陳樂榣、蕭唯展與太太江若琳及兒子Owen入場湊熱鬧。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.920778+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T10:07:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.793717+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.063488+00:00","content_hash":"c9632a3e46310f7871bd8f47e4bd4164c55a8dc2084c8a90595ee197b80960e6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}